  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-view qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><h2 id=\"link-0\" data-id=\"h490b8bf-ICbaSCcj\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">步骤1：创建数据库</span></h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-AM2AGvXg\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">巨量开发者登录开放平台后点击</span><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/cloud/volc/mysql\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">&nbsp;https://ad.oceanengine.com/cloud/volc/mysql&nbsp;</span></a>跳转连山控制台按页面提示创建MySQL</p><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-NyGd5IFi\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-y4VKJYVO\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\"><span style=\"background-color: #f5f5f5;\">注意：数据库和私有网络务必选择北京机房，否则数据无法同步</span></span></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-QJtgdggI\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\"><span style=\"background-color: #f5f5f5;\">磁盘空间预估：1W条有消耗创意，每周约占用1.2G左右的空间，每天平约落库0.17G的报表数据</span></span></p></blockquote><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-id=\"pa028eb2-3kUHWdvc\"><img src=\"https://p3-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/04bfe24279da4c7596cb787394760c4c~noop.image?x-expires=1988691560&amp;x-signature=ejAB4ee%2BODWBK%2F2l0fzz9TyZpok%3D\" style=\"visibility: visible; width: 748px; height: 360px;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p><h2 id=\"link-1\" data-id=\"h490b8bf-oEUAHQaX\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">步骤2：订阅RDS任务</span></h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-GbX5PElj\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">点击</span><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/developer/admin/rds/#/rds\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #338aff;\">https://open.oceanengine.com/developer/admin/rds/#/rds</span></a>&nbsp; 按照页面提示完成RDS订阅</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-id=\"pa028eb2-9ajjkRZB\"><img src=\"https://p6-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/04d5a951425746ef9471db5d1d9b151d~noop.image?x-expires=1988691560&amp;x-signature=h2BtLzISSNvXUKqSEamIJPmFOF0%3D\" style=\"visibility: visible; width: 746px; height: 403px;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p><h2 id=\"link-2\" data-id=\"h490b8bf-l2mRKn8D\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">步骤3：访问数据</span></h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-CR6XpDP7\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\"><strong>方式1：开启数据库公网访问</strong></span></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-ADVEkd8f\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">点击</span><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/cloud/volc/mysql\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #338aff;\">https://ad.oceanengine.com/cloud/volc/mysql</span></a>&nbsp;点击选中实例</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-id=\"pa028eb2-KEFL8K1A\"><img src=\"https://p26-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/8060f9c50ac74752bf38f4e9dd5c6286~noop.image?x-expires=1988691560&amp;x-signature=RwSR9tctMIFok5J4CdCvT1u9nCY%3D\" style=\"visibility: visible; width: 748px; height: 337px;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-ryANUXad\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\"><strong>方式2：数据库迁移（DTS）</strong></span></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-ouahXCYo\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">点击</span><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/cloud/volc/dts\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #338aff;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000000;\">https://ad.oceanengine.com/cloud/volc/dts</span></span></a>&nbsp;申请公测后配置即可，支持迁移公网MySQL与ES</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-id=\"pa028eb2-TbfkYW0Z\"><img src=\"https://p26-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/ec6708c76ba8430bab84bb41afe0072e~noop.image?x-expires=1988691560&amp;x-signature=GFxH4DbvTBTUeSVkGZFuTrIWIhM%3D\" style=\"visibility: visible; width: 732px; height: 399px;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-BJvlbw6V\"><br></p><h2 id=\"link-3\" data-id=\"h490b8bf-0XPlp7hL\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">步骤4：数据查询</span></h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-Rz28Te7G\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">查询指定计划8月29日累计展示量SQL示例</span></p><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22javascript%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22SELECT%20advertiser_id%2C%20ad_id%2C%20sum(%60show%60)%2C%20count(%60show%60)%5CnFROM%20%20lianshan_realtime_202208XX%5CnWHERE%20advertiser_id%3D17424770XXXXXXXX%20and%20%20stat_time%20%3E%3D%20'2022-08-29%2000%3A00%3A00'%20AND%20stat_time%20%3C%20'2022-08-30%2000%3A00%3A00'%5CnGROUP%20BY%20advertiser_id%2C%20ad_id%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ztGyf%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_contain qz-codeblock_inner\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_scroll qz-codeblock-scroll\" style=\"height: auto; overflow-y: scroll\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_content javascript\"></div></div></div></div></div>",
